{
  "_note": "`latin` lists the families the user can choose for Latin, Greek, and Cyrillic text. `scripts` maps every script the card can set to its Unicode Script name and, unless it uses the chosen Latin family, to one variable Noto font with weights on the wght axis. Fonts load only when a language that needs them is chosen. Licences sit beside the files. verifiedAt7pt is set only after a physical print has been checked by a native reader. `fallback` fills Latin, Greek, and Cyrillic characters the chosen family lacks.",
